  "fullContentHtml": "<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 225px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 36px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Name Of Post :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 36px; border-style: none;\">\n<h1>Bihar BCECEB Diploma Certificate Entrance Competitive DCECE PM / PE / PMM Admissions Download Result / Rank Card 2026</h1>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 35px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Post Date / Update :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 35px; border-style: none;\">11 June 2026 | 09:12 PM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 154px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 154px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 154px; border-style: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board (BCECEB) has released the Information Brochure for Diploma Certificate Entrance Competitive DCECE PE / PM / PMM 2026 Exam Can Apply Online from 19/03/2026 to 21/04/2026.candidates should read the Bihar DCECE 2026 information brochure for all the information related to the entrance exam like syllabus, eligibility, age limit, fees, Course and University List, information and other types of information and then apply.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"social-grid\">\n\n<div class=\"social-box telegram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%200%200'%