er=\"1\" width=\"760\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"765\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board BCECEB</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Bihar Diploma Certificate Entrance Competitive Exam 2026</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Bihar BCECEB DCECE 2026 : Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b></b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"399\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin <b>: 19/03/2026</b></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online <b>:<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">21/04/2026</span></b></li>\n<li>Last Date Pay Exam Fee <b>: 22/04/2026</b></li>\n<li>Correction Date<b> </b>:<b>23-24 April 2026</b></li>\n<li>Exam Date <b>: 23-24 May 2026</b></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available<b> : 15/05/2026</b></li>\n<li>Result Available : <strong>11/06/2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"366\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Single Course :</strong></li>\n<li>General / BC/ EBC: <b>750/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST&nbsp; : <b>480/</b>–</li>\n<li><strong>Double Course :</strong></li>\n<li>General / BC/ EBC: <b>850/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST&nbsp; : <b>530/</b>–</li>\n<li><strong>Triple Course :</strong></li>\n<li>General / BC/ EBC: <b>950/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST&nbsp; : <b>630/</b>–</li>\n<li>Pay the Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"765\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Bihar Polytechnic DCECE Notification 2026 <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Age Limit as on 31/12/2026 </span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Polytechnic Engineering PE :<strong> No Age Limit</strong></li>\n<li>Paramedical Course PMM : <strong>15-30 Years</strong></li>\n<li>Paramedical Course PM <strong>: 17-35 Years</strong></li>\n<li>For More Age Limit Related Information Must Read the Full Bihar Polytechnic DCECE 2026 Information Brochure</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"765\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Bihar <b>Combined Polytechnic PE / PMM / PM Admission Test <span style=\"color: #008000;\">DCECE </span> </b><span style=\"color: #008000;\">2026 Admissions Details</span></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"230\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Course Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"535\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Bihar DCECE Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"230\">\n<p align=\"center\">Polytechnic Engineering <strong>PE</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"535\">\n<ul>\n<li>Matric Class 10th Exam with Math &amp; Science Subjects</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"230\">\n<p align=\"center\">Paramedical Course Matric Level <strong>PMM</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"535\">\n<ul>\n<li>Matric Class 10th Exam with Math &amp; Science Subjects</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"230\">\n<p align=\"center\">Paramedical Course Inter Level <strong>PM</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"535\">\n<ul>\n<li>Matric Class 10th Exam with Math &amp; Science Subjects</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"765\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">For College Wise Bihar Diploma 2026 Seat Details Read the Notification.</span> </b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"765\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>How to Fill Bihar DCECE PE / PMM / PM Online Form 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board BCECEB Diploma Certificate Entrance Competitive DCECE 2026 Online Form Candidate Can Apply Between <b>19/03/2026 to 21/04/2026.</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Bihar DCECE Admission Test 2026.</li>\n<li><b>Scan Document Required : </b>Candidate should have its own valid Email id / Mobile number, Scanned / Soft copy passport size photograph, Hindi &amp; English Signature (Less than 100KB)<b> </b></li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"765\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Interested Candidate Can Read the Full Bihar DCECE 2026 Admissions Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"765\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"399\">\n\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"366\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"765\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td cols